    {
      "id": "calc_dev",
      "x": -760,
      "y": 6100,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "DEV NOTE: Roof Cost Calculator: Google integration\n\nFlow: address autocomplete → loading → satellite \"Is this your house?\" → roof size, steepest pitch + Asphalt/Metal price ranges → quote form (pre-filled) → thank you. If no roof data: fallback screen → free inspection.\n\nAll outside calls live in 5 SERVICE functions at the top of this page's script (marked). Replace their mock bodies:\n1. Places API (New) Autocomplete\n2. Place Details / Geocoding\n3. Solar API buildingInsights:findClosest (area + pitch)\n4. Maps Static API satellite image (or Maps JS map)\n5. CRM / lead endpoint\n\nPricing per sq ft is in pricing(). Keep the API key server-side. Google does not return roof material; add an imagery/AI provider if needed. Show 'powered by Google' with Places results.",
      "size": 24,
      "fill": "orange"
    },
    {
      "id": "sa_dev",
      "x": -760,
      "y": 37700,
      "w": 640,
      "text": "DEV NOTE: City pages (local SEO)\n\nOne page per city, all built from the same layout. Live URL for each: /tx/{city}, e.g. /tx/katy, /tx/sugar-land, /tx/pearland.\n\nEach city page links to the real service pages (Roofing, Siding, Windows, Gutters, Doors and every sub-service and material page).\n\nTo add a city: duplicate a City page, change its Service Area setting, and add its entry in cities(). Give each live page a unique title and meta description, e.g. 'Roofing, Siding & Windows in Katy, TX | The Crescent Builders'.",
      "size": 24,
      "fill": "orange"
    }
  ],
